  "question": "求 $\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}\\left(\\frac{1}{n^2 + n + 1} +\\frac{2}{n^2 + n + 2} +\\dots +\\frac{n}{n^2 + n + n}\\right).$",
  "answer": "$\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}x_n = \\frac{1}{2}$",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "夹逼准则",
    "极限计算"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 这是无穷和形式的极限。为化简数列，可将各分式的分母做适当的放大与缩小（形成公分母）达到通分化简的效果，再用夹逼原理求极限。"
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "记 $x_{n} = \\frac{1}{n^{2} + n + 1} +\\frac{2}{n^{2} + n + 2} +\\dots +\\frac{n}{n^{2} + n + n}$ ，则"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "\\frac {1 + 2 + \\cdots + n}{n ^ {2} + n + n} <   x _ {n} <   \\frac {1 + 2 + \\cdots + n}{n ^ {2} + n + 1}."
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "因为"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "\\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac {1 + 2 + \\cdots + n}{n ^ {2} + n + n} = \\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac {1}{2} \\cdot \\frac {n (n + 1)}{n ^ {2} + 2 n} = \\frac {1}{2},"
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "\\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac {1 + 2 + \\cdots + n}{n ^ {2} + n + 1} = \\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\frac {1}{2} \\cdot \\frac {n (n + 1)}{n ^ {2} + n + 1} = \\frac {1}{2}."
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "text": "根据夹逼原理得 $\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}x_n = \\frac{1}{2}$"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}x_n = \\frac{1}{2}$",
